t would be a stretch to do a W20: WW x M20:VA game with the official rulesets as is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-18T02:44:46-08:00","id":1435833,"title":"","content":"Wow! Someone actually liked my rant lol.<br /> <br /> I feel kinda bad about that. I\u2019m sort of moody and sometimes especially at certain times I go off on a tangent and say stuff I really don\u2019t mean and then feel bad about it later. Plus in this case I really didn\u2019t know all the stuff <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar617_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"617\" data-vbnamecard=\"617\">Heavy Arms</a> pointed out in his response to my post.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-18T04:48:07-08:00","id":1435842,"title":"","content":"<span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span>:<br /> <br /> Yeah. I, too, have written posts that afterwards didn't feel to be charming (so to speak). And got likes.<br /> <br /> But I try not to think much of likes, one can't be sure of what they mean other than a vague sense of agreement. You think your rationale was wrong, maybe they think it's rigth. But it could also be that they're agreeing with your fe