nimate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's why I said \u201cformally\u201d. Emancipation Proclamation, et al.</div> </div> </div> </div>Good point. My bad.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10394-lladas","name":"lladas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10394_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-12T12:26:59-08:00","id":1439495,"title":"","content":"I can see a couple of possibilities here: <br /> <br /> 1. The Traditions got the ball rolling. In this approach, I could see the Dreamspeakers and the Choristers leading the way.<br /> <br /> 2. This was one of the few honest to goodness wins for the idealists in the Order of Reason; probably lead by the Grand Faculty. <br /> <br /> 3. The Sleepers surprised everyone by doing this themselves. <br /> <br /> \u2026or some combination of the three. There <i>might</i> be an option where the Crafts are involved; but I doubt it: they're either too distant or too marginalized to manage something like this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-12T12:50:43-08:00","id":1439499,"title":"","content":"Well, I'm all in for humans being able to think for themselves, but I could see all of these going on - and I also imagine Disparate would likely be on board even if they can't do a whole lot to make it happen<br /> <br /> Another surprise posibility for you: There were economical interests<br /> <br /> It's the transition from slavery to proletariat that happened following the interests of the Industrial Revolution. If I'm not mistaken US was starting to transition from a big plantation to more industrialized forms of production arround this time, wasn't it?<br /> <br /> Industrialization require a different kind of worker: ppl with a salary, resposible for their own exploitation instead of being the subject of other people whims, with personhood. All good things if you want more ppl able to buy comodities, that incidentaly were being produced at very high rates just now.<br /> <br /> This is what the antecesors of the Syndicate would want, as a need for modern Capitalism to exist. I don't know whom of these would be more involved, but I would say perhaps both of them were on it. <hr />I'm no historian and haven't researched a lot about this, but I would be a bit cautious here: I would imagine slavery, and it's abolition, has a long and complicated story. That changes in different parts of the world.<br /> <br /> Recently heard about how spanish conquerors were forbidden to make &quot;indians&quot; their slaves by Christian law. Thus they invented their own version of the system of Encomienda, that was <i>far worse than slavery</i>...<br /> <br /> ...what a way to transform a good thing into a bad one <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1683,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","user":"Aleph","date":". 03-12-2021, 03:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-12T13:46:00-08:00","id":1439505,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1435611-victorian-mage-will-be-crowdfunded-by-opp-on-indiegogo-instead-of-ks?p=1439495#post1439495\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can see a couple of possibilities here:<br /> <br /> 1. The Traditions got the ball rolling. In this approach, I could see the Dreamspeakers and the Choristers leading the way.<br /> <br /> 2. This was one of the few honest to goodness wins for the idealists in the Order of Reason; probably lead by the Grand Faculty.<br /> <br /> 3. The Sleepers surprised everyone by doing this themselves.<br /> <br /> \u2026or some combination of the three. There <i>might</i> be an option where the Crafts are involved; but I doubt it: they're either too distant or too marginalized to manage something like this.</div> </div> </div> </div>Personally I favor the combination approach, though all working mostly separately from each other across the globe.<br /> <br /> Though if a table wanted to say play in backdrop of the American Civil War or involved in the Underground Railroad and use it as a platform for a cross-faction Cabal, I wouldn't oppose it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-12T13:46:27-08:00","id":1439506,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1435611-victorian-mage-will-be-crowdfunded-by-opp-on-indiegogo-instead-of-ks?p=1439452#post1439452\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you have a faction in a WW2 Mage game who represent the paradigm of Nazi Ideology, then obviously they're bad guys involved in supporting the results of that paradigm.</div> </div> </div> </div>...and I would stay far away from any group that would seriously run a game that allows playable Nazi mages on principle.<br /> <br /> (nvm that both the Union and Traditions would have bought into Axis ideology)<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1435611-victorian-mage-will-be-crowdfunded-by-opp-on-indiegogo-instead-of-ks?p=1439453#post1439453\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Because it's a fantasy game about a fictional bunch of technowizards that secretly rule the world?</div> </div> </div> </div>First off, &quot;secret masters that rules the world&quot; is a highly offensive anti-semitic conspiracy, one that was used by Nazis to justify committing the Holocaust.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Antisemitic_canard#World_domination\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/static/images/icons/enwiki-25.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Antisemitic_canard#World_domination\" target=\"_blank\"> Antisemitic trope - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Antisemitic_canard#World_domination\" target=\"_blank\"> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Antisemitic_canard#World_domination </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> And I'd like to ask to please not defend that or spin it in a positive light, especially trying to justify using it in tabletop game setting.<br /> <br /> Second...no they can't be, because if the Union was &quot;&quot;&quot;secret masters of the world&quot;&quot;&quot;, not only does Mage not make sense, then the rest of the World of Darkness as a setting makes no sense.<br /> <br /> If that was true there'd be no Ascension War, because the Union would have won. The Traditions and Crafts would be in a far worse state then they're depicted...but they obviously aren't. So either the Union is a lot more lenient on squashing Reality Deviants then how they claim, or they flat out aren't &quot;&quot;&quot;secret masters&quot;&quot;&quot;.<br /> <br /> Additionally, if it was...why are the other WoD gamelines a thing then? Why is the Union not immediately on and taking care of every single Masquerade breach themselves (nvm how is...any vampire still walking?) Why is every single caern not razed to the ground and every werewolf not purged out? How are changelings still even around?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I also think there's also a fundamental difference between ongoing ones and ones that are over a century ago. </div> </div> </div>I don't.<br /> <br /> The amount of time that has passed between then and now.<br /> <br /> And that &quot;well it happened centuries ago, so it shouldn't matter if I play with historical events in bad-faith ways&quot; is a supremely offensive and tone-deaf take.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-12T14:01:47-08:00","id":1439509,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1435611-victorian-mage-will-be-crowdfunded-by-opp-on-indiegogo-instead-of-ks?p=1439506#post1439506\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">First off, &quot;secret masters that rules the world&quot; is a highly offensive anti-semitic conspiracy, one that was used by Nazis to justify committing the Holocaust.</div> </div> </div> </div>Except the Technocracy aren't Jews. Kind of a big difference there. Also, the Technocracy officially allied with the Axis during WW2 to persecute Jews.<br /> <br /> So the theory is that the Far Right is the secret masters of the world as are big business anti-Semitic organizations. So much so that the Technocracy had a civil war over it.<br /> <br /> You do note that called Nazis &quot;Socialists&quot; is one of the tools of the Far Right, correct?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If that was true there'd be no Ascension War, because the Union would have won. The Traditions and Crafts would be in a far worse state then they're depicted...but they obviously aren't. So either the Union is a lot more lenient on squashing Reality Deviants then how they claim, or they flat out aren't &quot;&quot;&quot;secret masters&quot;&quot;&quot;. </div> </div> </div>The Ascension War officially ended with Revised and was stated to be a Technocratic victory. Then the Avatar Storm destroyed the Union and no one won.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1435611-victorian-mage-will-be-crowdfunded-by-opp-on-indiegogo-instead-of-ks?p=1439506#post1439506\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And that &quot;well it happened centuries ago, so it shouldn't matter if I play with historical events in bad-faith ways&quot; is a supremely offensive and tone-deaf take.</div> </div> </div> </div>Note: attempting to suppress fiction as a means of showing historical evils like the Tusla Riot in WATCHMEN and LOVECRAFT COUNTRY is another tool of the Far Right.<br /> <br /> I support all fiction that involves punching Nazis.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF