\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-12T15:20:02-08:00","id":1439523,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1435611-victorian-mage-will-be-crowdfunded-by-opp-on-indiegogo-instead-of-ks?p=1439509#post1439509\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Except the Technocracy aren't Jews. Kind of a big difference there. Also, the Technocracy officially allied with the Axis during WW2 to persecute Jews.<br /> <br /> So the theory is that the Far Right is the secret masters of the world as are big business anti-Semitic organizations. So much so that the Technocracy had a civil war over it.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's a bit more complicated than that. Yes, the NWO helped Hitler and Fascism rise to power as one of their experiments for models on ideal social and political control over the Masses. They did the same thing in Russia with Lenin and Communism. Likely this was all a reaction to WWI and just how damaging modern, global war can be and the Union's attempts to avoid it in the future.<br /> <br /> But then things really spiraled out of control and the Nephandi got involved (if they weren't involved in that from the start as when the Nephandi started really infiltrating the Union is unknown), leading to a Nephandi invasion that saw the Union purging many that backed the Nazis in the beginning and allying with the Traditions against the Nephandi and their Axis pawns. In fact one of the current leaders of NWO was veteran of that conflict and ex-CoX member that defected after WWII, having fought as part of one of the mixed faction Cabals that emerged during the conflict.<br /> <br /> Even the modern NWO hates what their predecessors did back then and that they having to wage all new struggles against the legacy of that evil.<br /> <br /> The Technocracy hates the Far Right. Not only are the legacy of one of the Union's worst sins, but they are science denying assholes that are making problems they're already struggling with worse and sowing more chaos among the Masses.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-12T15:25:00-08:00","id":1439525,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AkatsukiLeader13</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1435611-victorian-mage-will-be-crowdfunded-by-opp-on-indiegogo-instead-of-ks?p=1439523#post1439523\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The Technocracy hates the Far Right. Not only are the legacy of one of the Union's worst sins, but they are science denying assholes that are making problems they're already struggling with worse and sowing more chaos among the Masses.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I wouldn't go that far. The Technocracy had a Civil War in WW2 with the Nephandi infiltrated Axis-allied Technocrats being defeated. However, the Technocracy still had plenty of Far Right members that continued doing their Technocratic thing in America, South America, and presumably other parts of Europe.<br /> <br /> The Capitalist NWO vs. the Communist NWO for instance.<br /> <br /> The Technocracy would have had a second Civil War I'm sure if not for the fact that the Traditions were there to oppose both sides.<br /> <br /> The Technocracy of M20 seems to be leaning heavily toward a progressive left-leaning agenda but that's post-Avatar Storm when the leadership of the group was killed off.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-12T16:30:08-08:00","id":1439534,"title":"","content":"Er.... how can someone be &quot;progressive&quot; and at the same time, want to kill/forcefully assimilate everyone who disagrees with them or has a different religion? Or, I'm sorry, nonviolently cause everyone who disagrees with them to cease to exist/go extinct/be genocided by someone else/be forced to give up their religion/be forced to give up their culture/be erased from the cosmos/be conveniently murdered by psychotic Nephandi offscreen.<br /> <br /> The key part of progressivism is that the future is equally for everyone, not just The Superior Chosen People of _______. Once they replace Tolerance and Democracy with Genocide and Authoritarianism, it isn't progressive anymore. Like, not even remotely close. Not even with free healthcare for humans who agree to be assimilated.<br /> <br /> <br /> That's like being an atheist Hindu Russian Orthodox Catholic. Or a 100% living non-undead vampire who is also a corpse.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-12T16:31:37-08:00","id":1439535,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1435611-victorian-mage-will-be-crowdfunded-by-opp-on-indiegogo-instead-of-ks?p=1439509#post1439509\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Except the Technocracy aren't Jews. Kind of a big difference there. Also, the Technocracy officially allied with the Axis during WW2 to persecute Jews.<br /> <br /> So the theory is that the Far Right is the secret masters of the world as are big business anti-Semitic organizations. So much so that the Technocracy had a civil war over it.<br /> <br /> You do note that called Nazis &amp;quot;Socialists&amp;quot; is one of the tools of the Far Right, correct?<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> The Ascension War officially ended with Revised and was stated to be a Technocratic victory. Then the Avatar Storm destroyed the Union and no one won.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Note: attempting to suppress fiction as a means of showing historical evils like the Tusla Riot in WATCHMEN and LOVECRAFT COUNTRY is another tool of the Far Right.<br /> <br /> I support all fiction that involves punching Nazis.</div> </div> </div> </div>note that right wing propaganda also includes things about how important individual liberty is, and how the government is attempting to take those liberties away. Which is pretty antithetical to the Technocracy \u2014 or to the NWO, at least. <br /> <br /> But could we please not turn this into a debate about Left vs. Right? That's a whole other can of worms that can be, and has been, discussed thoroughly elsewhere, and doesn't really have much to do with the Victorian age anyway.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-12T17:05:20-08:00","id":1439545,"title":"","content":"What Data said on both accounts. It's clear at this point that we're going around in the same circle over and over again.<br /> <br /> So let's move on to something else in VAM.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-12T17:13:09-08:00","id":1439547,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1435611-victorian-mage-will-be-crowdfunded-by-opp-on-indiegogo-instead-of-ks?p=1439535#post1439535\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> note that right wing propaganda also includes things about how important individual liberty is, and how the government is attempting to take those liberties away. Which is pretty antithetical to the Technocracy \u2014 or to the NWO, at least.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Well it gets lip service, but if we\u2019re talking about things like QAnon, the whole central hope of the movement was a President declaring martial law so he could have all his political opponents killed. That was their \u201cgood ending\u201d as it were. So said platitudes toward liberty and small government are very very conditional on the conspiratorial right (by which I do not mean all conservatives)<br /> <br /> But I agree the NWO is not representative of a right wing group, they are specifically a thing out of the conspiracy OF the right in the early 90s. Hence all the scary \u201cOne World Government\u201d stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 03-12-2021, 08:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-12T17:21:55-08:00","id":1439549,"title":"","content":"All I\u2019ll say is that it\u2019s possible for someone to espouse anti-Semitic views and not be a Nazi, that anti-Semitism is not something exclusive to the Right, and that no, just because you didn\u2019t intend malice with a bigoted stereotype or trope, does not exonerate it for being harmful.<br /> <br /> And leave it at that. DM me if you want to talk more on that thread.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4418,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","user":"tasti man LH","date":". 03-12-2021, 08:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-12T17:28:36-08:00","id":1439554,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1435611-victorian-mage-will-be-crowdfunded-by-opp-on-indiegogo-instead-of-ks?p=1439534#post1439534\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Er.... how can someone be &quot;progressive&quot; and at the same time, want to kill/forcefully assimilate everyone who disagrees with them or has a different religion? Or, I'm sorry, nonviolently cause everyone who disagrees with them to cease to exist/go extinct/be genocided by someone else/be forced to give up their religion/be forced to give up their culture/be erased from the cosmos/be conveniently murdered by psychotic Nephandi offscreen.<br /> <br /> The key part of progressivism is that the future is equally for everyone, not just The Superior Chosen People of _______. Once they replace Tolerance and Democracy with Genocide and Authoritarianism, it isn't progressive anymore. Like, not even remotely close. Not even with free healthcare for humans who agree to be assimilated.<br /> <br /> <br /> That's like being an atheist Hindu Russian Orthodox Catholic. Or a 100% living non-undead vampire who is also a corpse.</div> </div> </div> </div>The present day meaning of &quot;Progressive&quot; would exclude that possibly. Most of my life I've been a Liberal. Now &quot;Liberal&quot; means Right-wing capitalist. I'm still in shock because I was raised to see the term meaning &quot; committed to individual rights and far less than reverant towards capitalism.&quot; But now it's nearly the same thing as fascism. <br /> <br /> Political terms change their meaning regularly. The Victorians had a radically different political vocabulary and symbols. <br /> <br /> Also, thanks to people like Locke, Franklin, Jefferson, Thomas Paine, Frederick Douglas, Abraham Lincoln, Susan B. Anthony, Mark Twain, Mary Harris Jones, T.R., FDR, Eleanor Roosevelt, Dr. King, and many others, we have expanded the meanings of terms like &quot;the Nation&quot; or &quot;the People.&quot; And expanded these terms in ways previously unimaginable. <br /> <br /> The Victorians gave us a base to go far beyond them. And because we embraced the gift, we often see how appalling the Victorians where. &quot;A dwarf on the giant's shoulders sees the furthest of the two.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":857,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","user":"Astromancer","date":". 03-12-2021, 08:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-12T17:28:55-08:00","id":1439555,"title":"","content":"My point isn't about whether or not the propaganda is valid; that's a whole separate issue that, again, isn't (IMHO) something we should be discussing at length in this thread. My point is that you shouldn't just cherry-pick the pieces of propaganda that seem to fit your arguments and ignore the rest. <br /> <br /> But again, that's not something we should be spending bandwidth on on the thread that's ostensibly about the Victorian Mage Crowdfunding project.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-12T17:36:21-08:00","id":1439559,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1435611-victorian-mage-will-be-crowdfunded-by-opp-on-indiegogo-instead-of-ks?p=1439555#post1439555\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My point isn't about whether or not the propaganda is valid; that's a whole separate issue that, again, isn't (IMHO) something we should be discussing at length in this thread. My point is that you shouldn't just cherry-pick the pieces of propaganda that seem to fit your arguments and ignore the rest. <br /> <br /> But again, that's not something we should be spending bandwidth on on the thread that's ostensibly about the Victorian Mage Crowdfunding project.</div> </div> </div> </div>Agreed. Just trying to be helpful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-13T06:07:01-08:00","id":1439634,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1435611-victorian-mage-will-be-crowdfunded-by-opp-on-indiegogo-instead-of-ks?p=1439506#post1439506\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">First off, &quot;secret masters that rules the world&quot; is a highly offensive anti-semitic conspiracy, one that was used by Nazis to justify committing the Holocaust.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes the entire setup of MtA, and many other WoD games especially VtM, is based on conspiracy theories popular in media in the 90s (*gestures at X-files up through the Matrix*) while ignoring the antisemitic roots of those theories. This is not news.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Second...no they can't be, because if the Union was &quot;&quot;&quot;secret masters of the world&quot;&quot;&quot;, not only does Mage not make sense, then the rest of the World of Darkness as a setting makes no sense. </div> </div> </div>Well first of all the setting indeed doesn\u2019t make sense, but suspending the disbelief necessary, the Technocracy\u2019s position as \u201cthe Authority\u201d is necessary for it to make any sense at all because why would people have stopped believing in literal magic in a world where it objectively exists unless the people hiding it were in the positions of power to do so?<br /> <br /> The Union being \u201cthe Man\u201d as it were was also thematically necessary for the game\u2019s intended anti-authoritarian vibe.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If that was true there'd be no Ascension War, because the Union would have won. </div> </div> </div>Yes that was Revised edition\u2019s position.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Additionally, if it was...why are the other WoD gamelines a thing then? Why is the Union not immediately on and taking care of every single Masquerade breach themselves (nvm how is...any vampire still walking?) Why is every single caern not razed to the ground and every werewolf not purged out? How are changelings still even around? </div> </div> </div>Because the games ignore each other where they\u2019d otherwise get in each other\u2019s way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 03-13-2021, 09:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-13T06:54:27-08:00","id":1439638,"title":"","content":"Also just for clarification that antisemitism has not historically been inclusive to all Jewish people but was specifically constructed around anti-European Jewish beliefs. This is to highlight how the creation of this concept was inclusive to a form of whiteness while excluding other types of otherness for very specific reasons (e.g., antiblackness, anti-Arabness). Namely to replicate and alleviate internal tensions around the external practice of colonization and racism in the metropole. <br /> <br /> Not to mention the utility of the antisemitism critique has been extensively damaged by the use of it by the United States and other supporters of the Israeli state to continue the colonization of Palestine. Everyone wants to forget that the Rabbis of Palestine were against the creation of the Israeli state and the dispossession of the Palestinian people. Not to mention Israel's willingness to marginalize and exclude Ethiopian Jews from full and equal membership in the state despite the claim that it is somehow a Jewish state. This is only to say that virtue signaling with antisemitism really ain't cool shit.<br /> <br /> And the reason why the myth of the secret masters of the world was created isn't because it is not true but because Christian European colonizers needed to hide the fact that they were the secret masters of the world. I don't know what you would call colonialism other than a process of world domination by a secret cabal of elites detached from the material atrocities they enacted.<br /> <br /> Seriously, how is the myth of the Age of Discovery and its material application in the discovery doctrine as expounded by Chief Justice John Marshall not understood to be the greatest act of conspiracy among a secret order of elites that quite literally changed how reality was understood for everyone? For those who don't know it basically states that if you are a citizen of Christian monarchy or government and you travel somewhere where the people aren't you have allodial title to that land. The bodies of the oppressed have always been used to scapegoat the real actions of the oppressor. Sure we know this history but remember that this was perpetuated against millions who had no way of knowing them or engaging it. Our acceptance that they weren't acting as the secret masters of the world is the fucked up part.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":10394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10394-lladas","user":"lladas","date":". 03-13-2021, 10:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10394-lladas","name":"lladas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10394_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-13T07:14:37-08:00","id":1439641,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lladas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1435611-victorian-mage-will-be-crowdfunded-by-opp-on-indiegogo-instead-of-ks?p=1439638#post1439638\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also just for clarification that antisemitism is inclusive to all people who speak a Semitic language--Arabic being the largest--despite how it has been exclusively used to refer to anti-Jewish and more explicitly anti-European Jewish beliefs. Not to mention the utility of the antisemitism critique has been extensively damaged by the use of it by the United States and other supporters of the Israeli state to continue the colonization of Palestine. Everyone wants to forget that the Rabbis of Palestine were against the creation of the Israeli state and the dispossession of the Palestinian people. Not to mention Israel's willingness to marginalize and exclude Ethiopian Jews from full and equal membership in the state despite the claim that it is somehow a Jewish state. This is only to say that virtue signaling with antisemitism really ain't cool shit. And the reason why the myth of the secret masters of the world was created isn't because it is not true but because Christian European colonizers needed to hide the fact that they were the secret masters of the world. I dont know what you would call colonialism other than a process of world domination by a secret cabal of elites detached from the material atrocities they enacted.</div> </div> </div> </div>I call colonialism the open and public conquest of the world with no secret cabal (where do you think that word comes from by the by?) involved.<br /> <br /> The secret masters trope is deeply historically antisemitic - hence the root of \u201ccabal\u201d, as is changing the topic to the state of Israel as a deflection to accuse people of \u201cvirtue signaling\u201d about antisemitic tropes that effect people in the real world today (points to QAnon). \u201cThere is a real secret cabal of elites that are using Jews as a distraction\u201d is in fact specifically how QAnon supporters lie about not being antisemites while they\u2019re literally cribbing Blood Libel. The actual powerful elites are on Forbes 500 lists and brag about the reach of their influence, there is no secret conspiracy involved.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 03-13-2021, 10:16 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-13T07:21:00-08:00","id":1439642,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1435611-victorian-mage-will-be-crowdfunded-by-opp-on-indiegogo-instead-of-ks?p=1439641#post1439641\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I call colonialism the open and public conquest of the world with no secret cabal (where do you think that word comes from by the by?) involved.<br /> <br /> The secret masters trope is deeply historically antisemitic - hence the root of \u201ccabal\u201d, as is changing the topic to the state of Israel as a deflection to accuse people of \u201cvirtue signaling\u201d about antisemitic tropes that effect people in the real world today (points to QAnon). \u201cThere is a real secret cabal of elites that are using Jews as a distraction\u201d is in fact specifically how QAnon supporters lie about not being antisemites while they\u2019re literally cribbing Blood Libel. The actual powerful elites are on Forbes 500 lists and brag about the reach of their influence, there is no secret conspiracy involved.</div> </div> </div> </div>Right, but I am trying to highlight that it wasn't public conquest. That it was only public for the metropole and the colonies. Again, just because we know about it doesn't make it not secret. The capacity for the IMF or for the Forbes 500 list to do what they do is inherently occluded--or made secret--regardless of our belief that it is transparent. Bragging does not mean the choices you make or the actions you take are not secret or conspiratorial. Conspiring to build a monopoly behind closed doors is a secret conspiracy <br /> <br /> Were the actions of the colonizers made public to the colonized? What is the supreme court's capacity to create laws that change reality internationally? I am not saying the trope isn't antisemitic, but that the historical rationale for developing that trope was in relation to the real world process of colonization.<br /> <br /> A lot of problematic tropes were created to either actively or passively avoid the dissonance created through colonial actions. Call the Native a savage so that when you rape and murder those people you can't be a savage. Call the enslaved a commodity so that you can own them while strengthening your self concept of being a free and liberated citizen.<br /> <br /> Also, right cause everything I have said points to being for QAnon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":10394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10394-lladas","user":"lladas","date":". 03-13-2021, 10:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10394-lladas","name":"lladas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10394_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-13T07:39:31-08:00","id":1439646,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1435611-victorian-mage-will-be-crowdfunded-by-opp-on-indiegogo-instead-of-ks?p=1439641#post1439641\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <b>I call colonialism the open and public conquest of the world with no secret cabal (where do you think that word comes from by the by?) involved.</b><br /> <br /> The secret masters trope is deeply historically antisemitic - hence the root of \u201ccabal\u201d, as is changing the topic to the state of Israel as a deflection to accuse people of \u201cvirtue signaling\u201d about antisemitic tropes that effect people in the real world today (points to QAnon). \u201cThere is a real secret cabal of elites that are using Jews as a distraction\u201d is in fact specifically how QAnon supporters lie about not being antisemites while they\u2019re literally cribbing Blood Libel. The actual powerful elites are on Forbes 500 lists and brag about the reach of their influence, there is no secret conspiracy involved.</div> </div> </div> </div>In fact, actually, colonialism depended greatly on hiding itself. Before the British Empire directly took over the administration of conquests, its corporations were actually doing the administration itself. And they used a series of proxies and puppets to do so. Local leaders that existed as the public faces of European misrule that were propped up to provide a veneer of legitimacy while their &quot;advisors&quot; carried out the plunder of the region. It is the very definition of conspiracy and manipulation the way the Union does it.<br /> <br /> Because they were trying to hide just how exploitative and corrupt the system was.<br /> <br /> The Far Right and corporations have always tried to hide the control of the world being done with hidden money and influence as well as bribery. Jews and other minorities being scapegoats for their agenda.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/05/Dirty_Money.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Edit:<br /> <br /> There's also the somewhat Doylist irony. The Technocracy is based, at least on part, on Steve Jackson's Illuminati. And the thing about Steve Jackson's Illuminati is it is a card game designed to MAKE FUN of conspiracy theories. Racist and otherwise. It's just that there's a bit of ludonarrative dissonance in that Gothic Punk World of Darkness is very much the antithesis of the Far Right conspiracy theories that many have latched onto and the two have essentially gone in wholly different directions narrative wise since the Nineties.<br /> <br /> The Technocracy and Pentex are designed around critiques of Western capitalism, the Far Right, and the Military Industrial complex.<br /> <br /> Racist conspiracy theories are, well, racist and pro Far right.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 03-13-2021, 10:47 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-13T07:41:54-08:00","id":1439647,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1435611-victorian-mage-will-be-crowdfunded-by-opp-on-indiegogo-instead-of-ks?p=1439646#post1439646\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> In fact, actually, colonialism depended greatly on hiding itself. Before the British Empire directly took over the administration of conquests, its corporations were actually doing the administration itself.<br /> <br /> And they used a series of proxies and puppets to do so.<br /> <br /> Because they were trying to hide just how exploitative and corrupt the system was.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ok fair, but there\u2019s a big difference between the East India Company, or Leopold II trying to maintain the Congo as his private property to avoid oversight, and secret cabals of elites in groups that have no public existence.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-13T07:45:08-08:00","id":1439649,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1435611-victorian-mage-will-be-crowdfunded-by-opp-on-indiegogo-instead-of-ks?p=1439646#post1439646\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> In fact, actually, colonialism depended greatly on hiding itself. Before the British Empire directly took over the administration of conquests, its corporations were actually doing the administration itself.<br /> <br /> And they used a series of proxies and puppets to do so.<br /> <br /> Because they were trying to hide just how exploitative and corrupt the system was.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you.<br /> <br /> There is a lot of scholarship on how the Holocaust--as the greatest act of antisemitism--occurred as a process of settler colonialism turned inward on Europe (hence why uniquely horrifying it was to Europeans as compared to ya know what they always were doing). Hitler loved the eugenics work of what was being done here in the States. The practices of mass eradication were pulled from the colonization playbook. This is <b>again </b>not to say that antisemitism is not bad or that QAnon is fucking good, but to highlight that laying a critique against against a fictional organization that represents colonization is antisemitic because they are the secret world masters really speaks to not understanding why antisemitism was created and implemented.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10394-lladas","name":"lladas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10394_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-13T07:46:17-08:00","id":1439650,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1435611-victorian-mage-will-be-crowdfunded-by-opp-on-indiegogo-instead-of-ks?p=1439647#post1439647\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ok fair, but there\u2019s a big difference between the East India Company, or Leopold II trying to maintain the Congo as his private property to avoid oversight, and secret cabals of elites in groups that have no public existence.</div> </div> </div> </div>Only if you are white. This isn't to be snarky, but to push back against an easy definition of who the public that matters is in these statement.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10394-lladas","name":"lladas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10394_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-13T07:49:11-08:00","id":1439651,"title":"","content":"<b><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">I'm actually going to infraction myself here. The antisemitism conversation is getting way off topic. My apologies.<br /> <br /> Everything else is fine.</span></b><br />",